{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50635","headline":"题云居上寺 · 王益","name":"题云居上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[支]公禅诵处，绝顶共登攀。\n日色千峯里，钟声万壑间。\n[暮]猿吟砌近，沙鸟傍溪闲。\n一迳[堪]藜杖，行行独下山。\n（见《金石萃编》卷一百五。\n）（缺文据《续古文苑》卷四补。\n《房山石经题记汇编》首字不缺。\n）（〖1〗石刻诗次王潜诗後。\n原题曰「同前」。\n下署「男益上」。\n与吉逾诗序所称「息益」合。\n〖2〗王益，原作吉益。\n爲王潜之子，详前吉逾条附考。\n诸书录石刻。\n此诗收於王潜诗之次，署「男益上」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}